# Use Bun workspace imports, never tsconfig paths

- Do not add, edit, or rely on `compilerOptions.paths` entries in any `tsconfig*.json`
- All cross-package imports must use the monorepo workspace names (e.g. `@vertix.gg/<package>/...`)
- If a module cannot be resolved, fix the workspace dependency graph rather than introducing tsconfig path aliases
- Bun's workspace resolution must remain the single source of truth for import paths
